cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HebOCRBench, cite this software and the exact corpus/suite fingerprints reported by your run."
title: "HebOCRBench: A Modern Hebrew OCR Benchmark"
version: 1.0.0
type: software
date-released: 2026-07-26
authors:
  - name: HebOCRBench contributors
repository-code: "https://github.com/office883/HebOCRBench"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - OCR
  - Modern Hebrew
  - RTL
  - Unicode
  - document understanding
  - table recognition
  - robustness
abstract: >-
  HebOCRBench evaluates Modern Hebrew OCR in logical Unicode order across
  line recognition, blind page OCR, reading order, tables, controlled image
  degradation and mixed Hebrew-Latin bidirectional text.
